# Drizzle
# Migration 进 git (主人 2026-09-18 拍): 迁移历史 = 部署真相
#   背景: 之前 `*.sql` + `drizzle/meta/` 把整个 drizzle/ 挡住了 → 7 个 migration
#        + down.sql 从未进过 git (git clone 无 migration, CI db:compat 也扫不到)
#   保留忽略: *.sql.gz / *.sql.gpg (备份副本, 不进 git)
#   注: 负向规则必须**先放开被忽略的目录本身** (drizzle/meta/), 否则 git 不会下沉看子文件
drizzle/meta/
drizzle/*.json
!drizzle/meta/
!drizzle/meta/*.json
!drizzle/*.sql
!drizzle/down/*.sql

# Project-specific (按需放开)
# .muse-station-state/

# Backups (不进 git) — 旧版 tools/backup.sh 用的根目录 backups/, 已 deprecated
/backups/
*.sql
*.sql.gz
*.sql.gpg
!drizzle/*.sql
!drizzle/down/*.sql
!drizzle/audit_trigger.sql

# 备份脚手架 (dev-domain-backup SOP §3.0)
# - data/ 整体: 含密钥 + 健康 state + 备份副本
# - /home/tooyan/nuankebao-databackups: 项目外独立备份目录 (防 rm -rf 误删)
# - /media/tooyan/<盘符>/nuankebao-*: 异地盘备份副本 (dev 机器当前未挂载, 路径待补)
data/
/home/tooyan/nuankebao-databackups

# 路径配置 (AGENTS §6.3 + deploy/README.md §11)
# - deploy/paths.conf.example: 提交, 注释齐全的样板
# - deploy/paths.conf:         gitignored, 主人当前机器真值 (每台机器一份)
# - ~/.config/nuankebao/paths.conf: gitignored, systemd EnvironmentFile 真正读的
deploy/paths.conf

